@startuml
title KodaMate - Sequence chat (question/reponse)

actor Utilisateur
participant "App MAUI\n(ChatPage)" as App
participant "Distributeur API\nFastAPI" as API
participant "Webhook 1\nn8n" as N8N

Utilisateur -> App: Ecrire question
App -> API: POST /api/trigger-n8n\n{question}
API -> N8N: POST webhook flux 1\n{user_name, question}
N8N --> API: JSON reponse
API --> App: response/answer/output...
App --> Utilisateur: Afficher bulle KODA
@enduml

